</div>

<p>Here=E2=80=99s the function now. Note that we have to remember to replac=
e the stack pointer before
returning!

</p><pre class=3D"prettyprint lang-asm"><span class=3D"pln">&nbsp; &nbsp; &=
nbsp; &nbsp; global &nbsp;example<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; section .t=
ext<br>example:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; sub &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><sp=
an class=3D"kwd">rsp</span><span class=3D"pln">, 24<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;=
 &nbsp; mov &nbsp; &nbsp; qword [</span><span class=3D"kwd">rsp</span><span=
 class=3D"pln">+8], 7<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; mov &nbsp; &nbsp; </sp=
an><span class=3D"kwd">rax</span><span class=3D"pln">, </span><span class=
=3D"kwd">rdi</span><span class=3D"pln"><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; imul=
 &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class=3D"kwd">rax</span><span class=3D"pln">, [<=
/span><span class=3D"kwd">rsp</span><span class=3D"pln">+8]<br>&nbsp; &nbsp=
; &nbsp; &nbsp; add &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span class=3D"kwd">rax</span><spa=
n class=3D"pln">, </span><span class=3D"kwd">rsi</span><span class=3D"pln">=
